 "description": "CZC 2022, is an all-India eco-innovation and entrepreneurship competition, that aims to accelerate the lab-to-market transition of eco-innovations in India by funding innovations from proof-of-concept, lab-scale solutions to working prototypes or pilots. The Theme for CZC 2022 is Circularity in Resources Conservation. The idea is to highlight the need to balance demand and the earth's supply through resource conservation, rethinking design and materials to enable the reduction, recycling, recovery and reuse of resources. The industry and public service systems need non-polluting technology to achieve this with low carbon, water and land footprint. And today the top 30 teams embark on their journey with the Carbon Zero Challenge.",
